{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014F9qBjt2q9WU8K66CgyBJV","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Meta-Repo Status — Blackboard\n2\t\n3\tThe **working surface** for developing the kit itself — the same `status.md`\n4\tpattern the kit scaffolds downstream, self-applied. This file is **forward-only**:\n5\tonly what must happen **next** lives here. Everything backward-looking has a\n6\thome elsewhere — don't restate it here:\n7\t\n8\t- **What shipped / verdicts / session record:** [log.md](log.md).\n9\t- **Owner decision briefs:** [open-items.md](open-items.md) — one `## OI-N`\n10\t  section per pending decision (blast radius, options, recommendation); a\n11\t  ruling appends to the log's Decisions and the section is removed.\n12\t- **The WI registry (every backlog + deferred item, with its reason):**\n13\t  [work-items.csv](requirements/work-items.csv) — the dashboard is the root\n14\t  [`PROJECT_STATE.html`](../PROJECT_STATE.html).\n15\t- **Design history:** [archive/](archive/README.md).\n16\t- **Process (kit source):** [PROCESS.md](../project-trajectory/PROCESS.md) ·\n17\t  [PROCESS_OPTIONS.md](../project-trajectory/PROCESS_OPTIONS.md) (this repo has\n18\t  no scaffolded `docs/process.md`; the masters are the reference).\n19\t- **Working rules:** [CLAUDE.md](../CLAUDE.md) + the `session-protocol` skill.\n20\t\n21\t---\n22\t\n23\t## Current State\n24\t\n25\t- **Active gate:** runnable **G2** (derived — `scripts/derive_gate.py`;\n26\t  per-phase `(default)=G3;v2=G3;v3=G2`, cached to [`docs/gate`](gate)). **Phase\n27\t  v3 (dashboard-ux) is decomposed to G2** (the `[v3]-[g2]` batch, log.md\n28\t  2026-07-14): each v3 SR owns its LLR+TC; the three Critique rows own their\n29\t  `docs/rubrics/dashboard-*.md`. **Phase v2 is at G3** (the intake/decision-loop\n30\t  panels + decomposition render polish shipped 2026-07-14). v3 stays G2 until the\n31\t  last dev slice (**WI-144**) lands. Spine: **SN=24 SR=56 LLR=57 TC=57**\n32\t  (orphan